  - m_Id: 65716523008
    m_Localized: Greetings adventurer!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96225890304
    m_Localized: How is it going with finding the lock to the key?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148038127616
    m_Localized: I am sure it can't be too far away from here as we found the chest
      in the abandoned outskirts of the town just on the way up from here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 180074221568
    m_Localized: 'Don''t worry, I will make sure that that greedy worm does not lay
      its hands on the key if you would ever be "rescued" by her again. '
